:0.38000000000000006},{"text":"advantages or disadvantages of schools teaching work","w":0.41333332061767575,"h":0.013215472941495943,"y":0.23387755069528515,"x":0.037777779468940051},{"x":0.035555560874452788,"text":"skills and giving career guidance.","h":0.011627906487912565,"w":0.25555555343627934,"y":0.2485465118723228},{"text":"SHOW WHAT YOU'VE LEARNT","w":0.26888889312744135,"x":0.50666666646802527,"h":0.013162078857421933,"y":0.052244897977033578},{"w":0.43333332061767577,"x":0.49555555649671773,"h":0.011836734693877582,"text":"6 Read the task below. Before you start writing, note","y":0.078367346821221262},{"h":0.011627906487912454,"text":"down some ideas and plan your work.","w":0.30444442749023437,"x":0.52000001355117886,"y":0.093023256058369364},{"text":"Recently it has become more difficult for young","x":0.51999999890959558,"w":0.37777778625488279,"h":0.011836734693877582,"y":0.11755102039592336},{"text":"people leaving school or university to find a job.","x":0.52000001754899072,"h":0.011836734693877582,"w":0.38666664123535155,"y":0.13224489798621353},{"h":0.013124110163474589,"text":"In your opinion, should all young people do","x":0.51777777997112817,"y":0.14530612233958562,"w":0.35111110687255864},{"h":0.011836734693877582,"x":0.51777779042971461,"w":0.395555534362793,"y":0.16122448966969405,"text":"internships or apprenticeships to give them work"},{"y":0.17587209334034604,"text":"experience? Write an essay on this topic. In your","w":0.38888889312744135,"x":0.51999999301961286,"h":0.011627906487912565},{"x":0.52000000037397931,"y":0.19186046532423018,"text":"essay:","w":0.051111111640930185,"h":0.0087209296713069984},{"h":0.011836734693877582,"x":0.5200000039999999,"text":"• give your main opinion about the topic,","w":0.31999999999999995,"y":0.20775510216755044},{"x":0.52000000443266059,"y":0.22081632635695847,"h":0.013195301756566913,"text":"• discuss the advantages (or disadvantages) of doing","w":0.40444442749023435},{"x":0.5333333439359853,"text":"internships and apprenticeships,","w":0.2488888740539551,"h":0.011627906487912565,"y":0.23546511632968714},{"h":0.011632652671969668,"text":"• mention other ways young people can get work","x":0.51999999620000015,"y":0.25000000030255531,"w":0.38},{"text":"experience,","y":0.26549224566884067,"h":0.011166671441525833,"w":0.091359424591064498,"x":0.53543139995477262},{"y":0.2775510202812379,"w":0.41111110687255858,"h":0.013146654245804745,"text":"• describe the effects of long-term unemployment on","x":0.52000000725816509},{"x":0.53333333294852703,"w":0.11555555343627932,"text":"young people,","y":0.29505813988824747,"h":0.010247982570103176},{"h":0.011627906487912565,"y":0.30813953505546232,"x":0.52000001127449536,"w":0.39333332061767579,"text":"• write your conclusion restating your main opinion"},{"text":"and including a final comment.","y":0.3212209300514457,"h":0.013081395674724883,"x":0.53555556382596836,"w":0.23777776718139643},{"text":"Many school-leavers struggle to get a job because businesses","w":0.41999999999999998,"x":0.022222226422222137,"h":0.011627906487912565,"y":0.28488372108743909},{"y":0.2979591838035186,"x":0.022222236774159007,"w":0.39555553436279289,"text":"are reluctant to employ people they think have few useful","h":0.011836734693877582},{"h":0.010357142857142843,"text":"skills and cannot think for themselves. Personally, I believe","y":0.31250000018984625,"w":0.41333332061767575,"x":0.022222232713384252},{"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"schools could do far more to prepare young people for","y":0.32558139569015221,"x":0.020000008538637707,"w":0.37777774810791015},{"h":0.013173944122937264,"text":"the world of work, and that this should be one of the main","x":0.017777790865993844,"y":0.33866279037121316,"w":0.40444442749023435},{"text":"purposes of education. To explain the reasons for this opinion,","x":0.022222227251093862,"y":0.35306122449884836,"w":0.42888889312744144,"h":0.011836734693877582},{"x":0.16664205806307081,"text":"the issue2","w":0.080049219131469729,"h":0.011772726020034541,"y":0.36475317148353481},{"y":0.38081395369645077,"h":0.011627906487912565,"w":0.35111110687255864,"x":0.022222228730387279,"text":"of teaching work skills and giving career guidance."},{"h":0.011627906487912565,"w":0.37777774810791015,"y":0.39825581439170255,"text":"When it comes to preparing for the workplace, there is","x":0.022222237131230074},{"text":"that learning practical and critical thinking","x":0.12666667712933574,"y":0.41133720935294305,"w":0.2999999809265137,"h":0.011627906487912565},{"x":0.02222223283114488,"y":0.42571428576222559,"h":0.011836734693877471,"text":"skills is part of a good all-round education. Learning to","w":0.38222221374511717},{"w":0.40222221374511713,"h":0.011836734693877693,"x":0.022222231488552388,"y":0.43877551033961315,"text":"prioritise tasks, cooperate in teams and work to a deadline"},{"w":0.41999999999999998,"y":0.45346938793589586,"x":0.022222226422222137,"text":"are skills that students can equally well use with schoolwork.","h":0.010204081632653073},{"h":0.013251067959532348,"y":0.46511627874330608,"x":0.022222226198526939,"w":0.25555555343627928,"text":"Teaching them at school could also 4"},{"h":0.013045943902463275,"x":0.37529848850782771,"w":0.071625247001647963,"text":"improved","y":0.46586074880308681},{"w":0.15999999046325683,"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"academic performance.","y":0.48110465160100491,"x":0.022222226916519733},{"y":0.49551020380929478,"text":"It is also important to 5","w":0.1599999904632568,"x":0.022222229360964095,"h":0.013210726368183989},{"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"with regard to career","w":0.14888888359069824,"x":0.28222222283428056,"y":0.49709302330643135},{"x":0.022222226917760535,"h":0.011836734693877582,"text":"guidance. It is often the case that this advice is out-of-date,","y":0.51142857138330922,"w":0.40888889312744142},{"w":0.42444442749023437,"y":0.52470930249732273,"x":0.022222236004882667,"text":"insufficient or non-existent, and students would really benefit","h":0.011627906487912565},{"x":0.024444453460774618,"y":0.53918367344197549,"w":0.38222221374511717,"h":0.011836734693877582,"text":"from learning more about how to evaluate and compare"},{"w":0.33575416564941402,"x":0.022121988798952472,"text":"information on different careers and study paths.","y":0.55221800103068053,"h":0.012004556461256422},{"h":0.0087209296713069984,"w":0.01111111044883728,"text":"6","y":0.56831395362364878,"x":0.02222222244224803},{"y":0.56976744225022968,"x":0.12666666733522788,"h":0.011627906487912565,"w":0.27777776718139646,"text":"some people say school standards have"},{"h":0.013081395674724883,"y":0.58284883682833522,"text":"dropped in recent years, and using class time to prepare","w":0.38222221374511717,"x":0.024444442386700908},{"y":0.59738372127154771,"w":0.40222221374511724,"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"students for work takes valuable time away from studying","x":0.022222219757071251},{"y":0.60897959185407491,"h":0.013113431346659654,"text":"subjects such as maths or languages, I'","x":0.022222227578156541,"w":0.2755555534362793},{"text":"this","h":0.010174418079609837,"w":0.028888888359069831,"y":0.61046511641441015,"x":0.39777777801490954},{"y":0.62489795934087999,"w":0.39111110687255857,"h":0.011836734693877582,"text":"time would be well spent studying transferable life skills.","x":0.024444450474831746},{"x":0.024444444230387462,"h":0.011836734693877471,"w":0.41111110687255864,"y":0.63795918378745398,"text":"They are just as useful in the classroom as in the workplace"},{"text":"and beyond.","y":0.65235119420200871,"w":0.084612417221069325,"h":0.01215807700643734,"x":0.022138236109539494},{"h":0.010207640978754817,"text":"In 8","x":0.024444445283617489,"w":0.026666665077209471,"y":0.66857142842442208},{"x":0.15111111097929339,"w":0.26222221374511723,"text":",I think learning practical and critical","y":0.67005813991852847,"h":0.010350023386429763},{"x":0.024444453757070869,"h":0.013134788980289303,"y":0.68163265282509633,"w":0.40222221374511719,"text":"thinking skills at school and having better career guidance"},{"w":0.39999999999999997,"y":0.69755102032637273,"x":0.024444449444444308,"text":"would be of enormous benefit to students, and not distract","h":0.010297816529565962},{"w":0.40888889312744142,"x":0.024444445732575523,"h":0.011836734693877582,"text":"them from their learning. Personally, I have found studying","y":0.71061224490382413},{"h":0.010219506244270149,"text":"these skills has increased my confidence and enabled me to","x":0.024444446414056992,"y":0.72529069786426492,"w":0.40888889312744137},{"x":0.024444463937879562,"text":"make better-informed choices about my studies and career.","y":0.73836734708361462,"w":0.40666664123535157,"h":0.011632652671969668},{"text":"SHOW THAT YOU'VE CHECKED","h":0.011836734693877582,"y":0.56244897977396024,"x":0.51111111839342871,"w":0.27777776718139646},{"x":0.50666667152041289,"h":0.013122923714773971,"text":"In my opinion essay:","y":0.58571428553247218,"w":0.17777776718139648},{"y":0.60638434471354041,"h":0.017894505092075907,"w":0.34945354461669931,"x":0.50858917616180999,"text":"• I have introduced the topic, stated my main"},{"x":0.5266666706955383,"text":"opinion and said which points of view or aspects","y":0.62354651182387322,"w":0.36888889312744133,"h":0.011627906487912565},{"text":"will be discussed.","x":0.52444444727055983,"y":0.63795918363432702,"h":0.010296630080865343,"w":0.13777777671813962},{"x":0.50888889590113651,"y":0.65697674443046239,"h":0.011627906487912454,"w":0.30666666030883782,"text":"• I have discussed the different aspects,"},{"text":"supported my main opinion and given","h":0.011836734693877582,"x":0.52444445446893984,"y":0.6714285716093652,"w":0.2933333206176757},{"h":0.010174418079609726,"y":0.68750000020801494,"w":0.077777776718139569,"text":"examples.","x":0.526666668168708},{"text":"• I have acknowledged an opposing opinion","w":0.3426237869262696,"x":0.50868606692952678,"y":0.70318079468819705,"h":0.015326178414481029},{"y":0.71947674450313681,"text":"and said why I disagree with it.","x":0.52444444255963818,"h":0.011627906487912565,"w":0.23555555343627932},{"y":0.7383673470897345,"text":"• I have used linking phrases and language to","x":0.50888888515631348,"h":0.013086141469527357,"w":0.35111110687255864},{"text":"express certainty and describe consequences.","y":0.75290697708550114,"h":0.011627906487912454,"w":0.35333332061767575,"x":0.5244444449133846},{"x":0.51111111463779479,"y":0.77180232563647477,"h":0.013095633837641452,"w":0.35111110687255864,"text":"• I have finished by restating my main opinion"},{"h":0.010174418079609726,"x":0.52444444788560673,"text":"and included a final comment.","y":0.78633720965568932,"w":0.23333332061767575},{"h":0.011627906487912565,"y":0.80813953512813674,"w":0.2155555534362793,"x":0.51111111486519367,"text":"• I have used a formal style."},{"w":0.22666666030883798,"h":0.011836734693877582,"y":0.83265306135122397,"x":0.51111111712335866,"text":"• I have checked my spelling."},{"text":"• my handwriting is neat enough for someone","x":0.51111112009856952,"w":0.35333332061767575,"y":0.85465116284131504,"h":0.011627906487912565},{"w":0.097777776718139697,"h":0.010174418079609837,"text":"else to read.","x":0.52666666882611535,"y":0.86918604679837341},{"x":0.91777777808483563,"text":"O","y":0.70930232530956738,"h":0.015988372491330449,"w":0.024444444179534952},{"w":0.026666665077209495,"x":0.92222222279472854,"y":0.96220930203182364,"h":0.013081395674724883,"text":"79"}]